{
 "subs": [
  {
   "text": "If a woman on the beach",
   "t0": 0.6,
   "t1": 1.948,
   "end": 2.198,
   "n": 18
  },
  {
   "text": "asks you to hold her",
   "t0": 2.198,
   "t1": 3.345,
   "end": 3.595,
   "n": 16
  },
  {
   "text": "baby, don't.",
   "t0": 3.595,
   "t1": 4.261,
   "end": 5.361,
   "n": 11
  },
  {
   "text": "My grandmother said that",
   "t0": 5.861,
   "t1": 7.089,
   "end": 7.339,
   "n": 21
  },
  {
   "text": "every winter in Shimane.",
   "t0": 7.339,
   "t1": 8.388,
   "end": 8.638,
   "n": 21
  },
  {
   "text": "I thought it was a story",
   "t0": 8.758,
   "t1": 9.986,
   "end": 10.236,
   "n": 19
  },
  {
   "text": "to keep kids off the rocks.",
   "t0": 10.236,
   "t1": 11.832,
   "end": 12.932,
   "n": 22
  },
  {
   "text": "The night my boat broke down,",
   "t0": 13.432,
   "t1": 15.103,
   "end": 15.353,
   "n": 24
  },
  {
   "text": "I walked back along the shore.",
   "t0": 15.353,
   "t1": 16.97,
   "end": 17.22,
   "n": 25
  },
  {
   "text": "A woman was kneeling by the",
   "t0": 17.34,
   "t1": 18.945,
   "end": 19.195,
   "n": 22
  },
  {
   "text": "water, soaking wet, holding a bundle.",
   "t0": 19.195,
   "t1": 21.513,
   "end": 22.613,
   "n": 32
  },
  {
   "text": "She asked me to hold her baby while",
   "t0": 23.113,
   "t1": 25.055,
   "end": 25.305,
   "n": 28
  },
  {
   "text": "she washed her hair.",
   "t0": 25.425,
   "t1": 26.459,
   "end": 26.709,
   "n": 17
  },
  {
   "text": "She smiled too wide.",
   "t0": 26.709,
   "t1": 27.993,
   "end": 29.293,
   "n": 17
  },
  {
   "text": "The baby was cold.",
   "t0": 29.793,
   "t1": 30.918,
   "end": 31.168,
   "n": 15
  },
  {
   "text": "Then heavy.",
   "t0": 31.168,
   "t1": 31.759,
   "end": 32.009,
   "n": 10
  },
  {
   "text": "Then heavier.",
   "t0": 32.009,
   "t1": 32.752,
   "end": 33.002,
   "n": 12
  },
  {
   "text": "My arms wouldn't let go.",
   "t0": 33.002,
   "t1": 34.759,
   "end": 36.459,
   "n": 20
  },
  {
   "text": "Behind her, something long",
   "t0": 36.959,
   "t1": 38.56,
   "end": 38.81,
   "n": 23
  },
  {
   "text": "slid out of the sea.",
   "t0": 38.81,
   "t1": 39.985,
   "end": 40.235,
   "n": 16
  },
  {
   "text": "It didn't stop coming.",
   "t0": 40.235,
   "t1": 41.73,
   "end": 43.83,
   "n": 19
  },
  {
   "text": "It wasn't her hair she was washing.",
   "t0": 44.33,
   "t1": 46.418,
   "end": 46.668,
   "n": 29
  },
  {
   "text": "It was her body.",
   "t0": 46.668,
   "t1": 47.518,
   "end": 47.768,
   "n": 13
  },
  {
   "text": "Hundreds of meters of it.",
   "t0": 47.768,
   "t1": 49.487,
   "end": 50.987,
   "n": 21
  },
  {
   "text": "I don't remember how I got free.",
   "t0": 51.487,
   "t1": 53.319,
   "end": 53.569,
   "n": 26
  },
  {
   "text": "I still have the bundle.",
   "t0": 53.569,
   "t1": 54.811,
   "end": 55.061,
   "n": 20
  },
  {
   "text": "It's a stone shaped like a baby,",
   "t0": 55.181,
   "t1": 56.893,
   "end": 57.143,
   "n": 26
  },
  {
   "text": "and it gets heavier every winter.",
   "t0": 57.263,
   "t1": 59.48,
   "end": 61.08,
   "n": 28
  }
 ],
